    "body": "Migrates the four remaining `src` stanzas \u2014 `menhirParser`, `CLI`, `b2t2` and `docslides` \u2014 to Jane Street Core. Small and mechanical, but it's what makes the migration total: **after this PR all 12 OCaml stanzas across 9 dune files are on Core.**\n\nTwo things that made this less trivial than the diff size suggests:\n\n- `menhirParser` needs the sweep to cover `.mll` and `.mly`, not just `.re`/`.rei`.\n- `src/CLI` already contained Core-shaped calls (`List.iter(xs, ~f=...)`) because it is written against libraries migrated earlier in this stack. A first-argument-only labelling pass double-labels those.\n\n## Verification\n`make dev` clean \u00b7 `make test-quick` green (3448) \u00b7 `dune build --profile release` warning-free across all four stanzas.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
